content.text:
Shipping's outgoing `/get-quote` HTTP call is the only real fault. Its effect carries through checkout and frontend to frontend-proxy. The remaining candidates (accounting, product-reviews, postgresql, kafka) show no change beyond normal baseline.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "shipping",
      "fault_kind": "http_slow",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_span_kind, count(*) n, round(approx_quantile(duration,0.5)/1e6,1) p50_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE (service_name='shipping' AND span_name IN ('POST quote','/get-quote','/ship-order')) OR (service_name='quote' AND span_name='POST /getquote') GROUP BY ALL ORDER BY 1,2",
          "claim": "Shipping's /get-quote server and its 'POST quote' client span take about 1620 ms; quote's server span takes about 0.3 ms."
        },
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_span_kind, count(*) n, round(approx_quantile(duration,0.5)/1e6,1) p50_ms FROM normal_traces WHERE (service_name='shipping' AND span_name IN ('POST quote','/get-quote','/ship-order')) GROUP BY ALL ORDER BY 1,2",
          "claim": "In the normal period shipping's /get-quote and 'POST quote' spans take about 1.5 ms."
        },
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT span_name, attr_span_kind, round(duration/1e6,1) ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='shipping' AND span_name='/ship-order' ORDER BY ms DESC LIMIT 5",
          "claim": "Shipping's /ship-order path stays fast (about 0.03 ms), so only the /get-quote HTTP path is affected."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {
      "from": "shipping",
      "to": "checkout",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_span_kind, round(approx_quantile(duration,0.5)/1e6,1) p50_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='checkout' AND span_name IN ('prepareOrderItemsAndShippingQuoteFromCart','oteldemo.CheckoutService/PlaceOrder') GROUP BY ALL",
          "claim": "Checkout's PlaceOrder and its shipping-quote preparation span both take about 1,630 ms, matching the shipping delay."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "checkout",
      "to": "frontend",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_span_kind, round(approx_quantile(duration,0.5)/1e6,1) p50_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='frontend' AND span_name IN ('grpc.oteldemo.CheckoutService/PlaceOrder','POST /api/checkout') GROUP BY ALL",
          "claim": "Frontend's checkout gRPC call and POST /api/checkout span both take about 1,640 ms."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "frontend",
      "to": "frontend-proxy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_span_kind, round(approx_quantile(duration,0.5)/1e6,1) p50_ms, count(*) n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='frontend-proxy' AND span_name='ingress' GROUP BY ALL",
          "claim": "Frontend-proxy ingress requests, which users reach, take about 1,640 ms at p50 in the abnormal period."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

